# Secret & API Key files (Never commit)
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
**/apikey.txt
**/secrets.json
**/*secret*

# UiPath Studio local/generated cache & build artifacts
**/.local/
**/.tmh/
**/.storage/

# Runtime logs and temporary files
**/Logs/
**/Temp/
*.log

# Office temporary lock files & backups
~$*
*.backup.xlsx
*.tmp
